# Production-only regressions: failures that main recorded after a green pull
# request (issue #1191). Each one names the narrowest pre-merge check that now
# replays it, so the same change fails before merge.
# rust/tests/web/main-only-regression-ledger.test.mjs checks that every check
# file exists and runs in the fast pull-request inventory, that a named
# workflow is the reusable native check release.yml calls on pull requests,
# and that the check still carries the replay marker.
#
# Regressions are grouped by the main run that recorded them, then by the kind
# of pre-merge check that now replays them:
#   javascript-twin   a JavaScript twin of a Rust gate, in the fast pull-request lane
#   workflow-policy   a workflow or layout policy test, in the fast pull-request lane
#   focused-native    the CI-only pull-request native check (never native or release evidence)
main-run 43710854562
